window.__T__=[{"i":4520,"text":"Create a high-resolution 8K portrait poster in an Urban Fashion Editorial Collage style, blending contemporary street-fashion aesthetics with premium editorial magazine design. The overall composition should feel bold, stylish, modern, and visually layered, combining elements of luxury fashion campaigns, urban culture, and artistic collage experimentation. Incorporate dynamic poster ornaments and decorative elements that strongly reflect the Urban Fashion Editorial Collage aesthetic, such as ripped paper textures, layered magazine cutouts, abstract geometric accents, expressive brush strokes, typography fragments, street-style graphic overlays, halftone textures, tape effects, paint splashes, handwritten scribbles, and fashionable editorial layout compositions. Every decorative element should feel intentional, stylish, and visually balanced rather than overcrowded. Humanity really looked at torn paper and graffiti textures and decided, “yes, this is luxury now.” Somehow it works.\n\nThe subject’s pose must not resemble the reference photo. Create a completely different body posture and facial expression with a more natural, expressive, and emotionally alive presence. Avoid stiff, awkward, flat, or overly symmetrical posing. The subject should radiate the confident elegance of an international fashion model, with fluid body language, subtle movement, and a cinematic editorial attitude. The expression should feel charismatic, effortless, fashionable, and modern, as if captured during a high-end streetwear magazine photoshoot rather than a static studio portrait. Add slight motion energy through posture, clothing movement, hand placement, camera angle, or gaze direction to make the composition feel more alive and dynamic.\n\nThe outfit must feature modern casual fashion with a stylish and trendy urban aesthetic. Avoid monotonous clothing design, colors, or materials. Combine fashionable layers, contemporary cuts, unique textures, stylish accessories, and varied color palettes that complement the poster composition. The clothing should feel premium, youthful, and fashion-forward, inspired by global streetwear and luxury casual editorial styling. Mix different fabric materials, patterns, and tones naturally to create visual richness without making the outfit look chaotic or overly exaggerated.\n\nUse dramatic editorial lighting with strong contrast and depth to enhance the fashion atmosphere. The background should integrate seamlessly with the collage elements, creating a visually immersive poster composition filled with layered urban energy and modern fashion identity. Maintain a clean balance between subject visibility and decorative complexity so the poster still feels premium and professionally art-directed. The final result should look like a sophisticated international fashion campaign poster with a strong urban editorial character, ultra-detailed textures, crisp focus, cinematic color grading, and highly polished visual quality in ultra-detailed 8K resolution.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/43473_out.png"]},{"i":4521,"text":"A CG image highlighting the \"DANCESLACK\" letters.\nTransform the letters into the center of a cinematic miniature world. Miami in July, with coconut trees, beaches, roads, and crowds.\nThe letters must remain clear, accurate, and easily recognizable, and must dominate the visual aspect.\nBuild a unique small world around the product: \n- Weather: Hot and humid, midday sun, clouds. \nUse miniature figures, small props, environmental narration, scale contrast, movie-level lighting, high-end commercial photography, shallow depth of field, clear product details, exquisite shadows, strong visual layers, and excellent advertising-level post-processing.\nThe images should be iconic, eye-catching, high-end, creative and have commercial influence.\nUnless the brand requires a playful style, do not make it look childish or like a toy. Maintain elegance, consciousness and individuality. \nThe picture maintains the real scene, the lighting is realistic, and the weather is true.\nAspect ratio: 9:16","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42944_out.png"]},{"i":4522,"text":"A young adult woman sitting beside a low table in a dim private room, leaning close to a laptop, looking up toward the camera with the feeling of a spontaneous late-night snapshot","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42936_out.png"]},{"i":4523,"text":"Avant-garde graphic design poster page, elegant editorial layout, off-white background, 4:5 aspect ratio. Build a clean asymmetrical modular grid with four distinct image blocks: one high-contrast close portrait of [HUMAN], one cinematic photograph of [CAR], one striking image of [ANIMAL], and one atmospheric photograph of [PLACE], each contained in its own rectangular block. \n\nUse black as the dominant color with subtle accents of [ACCENT1] and [ACCENT2], minimal but refined. Add one abstract distortion or texture panel to reinforce the experimental design language. Include a bold title reading “[TITLE]”, a small minimalist logo reading “[LOGO]”, microtypography, short editorial text columns, tiny serial numbers, thin dividers, small captions, and elegant negative space.\n\nHigh-fashion graphic design aesthetic, niche magazine page, refined Swiss-meets-avant-garde composition, crisp typography, monochrome photography, subtle blur and texture variation, sophisticated art-direction.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42497_out.png"]},{"i":4524,"text":"Ultra-realistic fashion editorial portrait of a confident woman in avant-garde white couture with dramatic structured shoulders, hands reaching toward camera (perspective distortion), intense gaze, long wind-blown messy hair, studio soft lighting, grey textured background, high contrast, Vogue-style.\nAdd overlays: face detection box centered on face, thin white frame with corner handles, subtle grid, UI markers, cursor, tracking points, experimental tech overlay, magazine layout with bold text “AVANT MODE”, barcode. Ultra-sharp, cinematic lighting, 8K, professional fashion photography, --ar 3:4 --v 6 --style raw","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42313_out.png"]},{"i":4525,"text":"A young adult woman sitting or half-crouching on top of an old concrete pillar, photographed from a very low angle. She wears a white floral lace fantasy outfit and holds a long sword, giving the image a romantic knight-princess portrait mood mixed with lolita fashion, fairytale warrior energy, and real outdoor flash photography.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42290_out.png"]},{"i":4526,"text":"Cybercore editorial fashion photography of the attached man wearing a modern white Korean-inspired outfit, walking confidently through the streets of Gangnam, Seoul, accompanied by a majestic white wolf. Realistic candid street photograph captured from a slightly elevated, surveillance-inspired perspective. Natural walking motion, relaxed posture, authentic urban atmosphere, stylish everyday fashion, and a calm cinematic mood.\n\nOverlay a refined futuristic HUD interface featuring a subtle face-detection frame, object labels, identity card panel, tracking points, timestamp, minimal biometric graphics, thin interface boxes, elegant scan lines, and small readable system data. Keep every interface element clean, minimal, well-spaced, and seamlessly integrated into the scene—never cluttered or distracting.\n\nCool white and soft blue color palette, realistic ambient lighting, polished editorial photography, soft contrast, ultra-sharp details, premium cyberpunk aesthetic, luxury fashion campaign, sophisticated futuristic design language, ultra-realistic, 8K, masterpiece.\n\nAspect ratio: 4:5. Generate for cristiano ronaldo","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42093_out.png"]},{"i":4527,"text":"请生成一张竖版 3:4 的高清商业广告海报，单张图片，不要拼图。\n\n主题是[产品类型]新品推广海报，原创虚构品牌，不要出现真实品牌 Logo。\n品牌名：[品牌名]\n产品名：[产品名]\n主标题大字：[主标题大字]\n副标题：[Slogan]\n主色调：[主色调]\n人物类型：[人物类型]\n功能卖点：[卖点一]、[卖点二]、[卖点三]、[卖点四]\n\n整体风格是“数码产品巨字透视 Campaign 海报”。产品必须作为 hero product 清晰展示，比例准确、材质真实、细节精致。人物要有广告大片感和明确姿态，可以手持产品、展示产品、佩戴产品或正在使用产品。\n\n主标题[主标题大字]使用超大号粗体无衬线字体，占据画面主要空间。文字要成为品牌背景墙、透视舞台、科技空间、地面通道或产品动线，有明显一点透视或斜切透视，清晰可读，视觉冲击强。人物、产品和巨型文字要处在同一个空间逻辑中，有前后关系、遮挡关系、接触阴影和统一光影。\n\n画面加入正式品牌广告信息系统：顶部品牌名，右上角 campaign 小字，侧边竖排信息，产品旁功能卖点图标，底部信息栏包含产品名、副标题、发布日期、参数、小字 credits、细线和条形码。整体高清锐利、高对比、有科技广告感，像真正发布的数码品牌 Campaign Poster。\n\n避免：拼图、真实品牌 Logo、廉价电商感、产品变形、人物假脸、背景杂乱、主标题不清楚、透视感太弱。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42090_out.png"]},{"i":4528,"text":"Create a premium 1950s–1960s vintage editorial poster featuring [Subject] as the central focus. The composition is a vertical movie-style magazine cover with the subject occupying approximately 70% of the frame in a confident, iconic pose. Use authentic mid-century modern graphic design, inspired by Saul Bass and classic travel/cinema posters. The background consists of bold geometric shapes, circles, triangles, diagonal blocks, and vertical stripes in muted mustard yellow, burnt orange, faded teal, olive green, charcoal black, cream, and beige.\nApply a realistic photographic look to the subject while blending seamlessly with the retro poster aesthetic. Use warm sepia color grading, faded inks, subtle halftone printing, distressed paper texture, worn edges, scratches, grain, faded colors, ink imperfections, and aged vintage printing effects.\nPlace a large bold uppercase title at the top reading \"[Title]\" using thick condensed sans-serif typography. Beneath it add a smaller slogan:\n\"[Tagline]\"\nInclude a subtle landmark, skyline, environment, or thematic background relevant to the subject near the bottom without distracting from the main figure. Keep the layout clean, symmetrical, and highly professional.\nThe lighting should be cinematic yet soft, with realistic shadows and excellent facial detail. Maintain premium print quality, ultra-sharp details, authentic retro magazine design, museum-quality vintage poster aesthetics, high contrast, balanced negative space, elegant composition, timeless branding, and a luxurious editorial feel.\nAspect Ratio: 2:3 (Portrait)\nStyle Keywords: vintage poster, retro magazine cover, mid-century modern, Saul Bass, editorial design, aged paper texture, distressed print, halftone, cinematic portrait, classic advertising, geometric composition, muted color palette, premium graphic design, realistic photography blended with vintage illustration, collectible poster, 8K.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42088_out.png"]},{"i":4529,"text":"A high-quality, professional portrait captured on a Hasselblad X2D 100C with an XCD 90mm f/2.5 lens. A beautiful young East Asian woman with long, natural dark brown hair styled in soft, loose waves stands in a bright, minimalist art gallery. She has a refined and elegant facial structure, clear skin with a subtle, glowing complexion, large expressive dark eyes, and a delicate pink-tinted lip. She wears a clean, minimalist white t-shirt featuring bold, black sans-serif typography that reads \"YOUR MINE\". She poses with one hand gently touching her chin in a relaxed, thoughtful gesture—a soft Chin Rest. The background features a large abstract painting in muted beige and cream tones, with warm natural light streaming through a skylight. Photorealistic style, sharp focus on the eyes, highly detailed skin texture, visible pores, subtle natural moisture, no beauty filter. Slight film grain, subtle chromatic aberration at the edges. A stray cat tail curls near the base of a sculpture at the bottom left corner.\ndutch angle, stray cat tail --ar 9:16","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42087_out.png"]},{"i":4530,"text":"A realistic vertical smartphone travel photo in a 9:16 aspect ratio. An adult young woman stands on a tropical or subtropical forest path, surrounded by dense green plants, tree trunks, vines, fallen leaves, and a shadowed walkway broken by sunlight. She leans slightly toward the camera, her head shifted a little to the right, with one hand raised near her forehead in a relaxed two-finger gesture, as if she had just paused under the trees for a spontaneous photo. She looks naturally into the lens with clear relaxed eyes, a closed-lip soft smile, gentle cheeks, and a subtle dimple. The expression should feel intimate, confident, and unforced.\n\nPreserve a soft oval face, natural eye shape, delicate nose bridge, full cheeks, clean skin, and slight smartphone beauty-filter softness. The makeup should follow an East Asian social-media / K-beauty travel aesthetic: translucent base, soft peach-pink blush, natural eyeliner, subtle under-eye softness, and rosy pink lips, without heavy contouring. Her hair is medium-long straight chestnut brown with a muted burgundy-purple undertone, lightly parted bangs, and ends falling over the shoulders and upper chest. It should have a slightly humid summer texture, a little naturally messy, with tiny leaf-filtered highlights on the crown. Black sunglasses rest on top of her head, and a black side bag with a pale printed shoulder strap appears along one side.\n\nShe wears a deep gray, slightly blue-purple, low-scoop sleeveless fitted mini dress or sporty one-piece. It has wide straps, a low rounded neckline, soft elastic fabric, natural tension curves around the chest, and horizontal wrinkles around the waist and abdomen from her leaning pose. The skirt has a side-tie or wrap-like detail. Visible skin includes the face, neck, collarbones, shoulders, both arms, underarm-adjacent area, upper chest/decolletage, and part of the upper thighs below the skirt hem. The waist, hips, back, and buttocks are mostly covered and should not be additionally exposed. Her skin tone is light warm with a peach-pink and pale golden outdoor cast. The skin should look smooth and soft to the touch, slightly warm from humid air, with a mild natural sheen on the shoulders, arms, collarbones, and upper chest, not plastic or over-smoothed.\n\nThe photo should feel like a close-range casual smartphone shot, around 24-28mm equivalent wide angle. Keep a mild wide-angle perspective so the raised arm and upper body feel closer to the viewer. The framing is a tight half-body to upper-thigh crop, with natural cropping of the raised arm, bag, and side edges, slightly shifted to the right rather than perfectly centered. Lighting is natural midday forest light: strong sun is broken by the tree canopy, creating irregular dappled highlights on the edge of the face, arms, collarbones, upper chest, and ground. Green foliage adds a faint cool bounce light, while shadows stay deep green and brown-black. Keep smartphone-photo imperfections such as local softness, slight motion blur, compression noise in the leaves, and a real unpolished travel-photo feeling. She had just lifted her hand against the sunlight, she is looking at the camera now, and she may laugh and keep walking in the next second.\n\nAvoid: underage appearance, excessive nudity, explicit sexualization, exaggerated body proportions, plastic skin, studio lighting, perfectly symmetrical commercial composition, anime style, CGI look, mirror selfie, distorted fingers, and overly blurred background.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42086_out.png"]},{"i":4531,"text":"Create a 9:16 high-end experimental portrait poster with a clean editorial layout.\nThe image should feel original, modern, visually striking, and design-driven.\nUse a single adult model as the main subject. Keep the face recognizable, while reshaping the portrait through controlled visual effects such as blur, scan distortion, subtle grid overlays, spotlight shadow, or chromatic glitch.\nTypography should feel custom, refined, and minimal, with an original title and a few short supporting phrases. Keep the layout clean, elevated, and poster-like.\n\n4 directions:\n\n1. STATIC VEIL\nA monochrome black-and-gray portrait poster.\nA young male model with a shaved head and bold geometric black sunglasses.\nThe head and glasses stay sharp, while the lower half of the portrait dissolves into horizontal scan distortion and stretched blur, as if the figure is being pulled into static.\nFine grain texture in the background.\nUse a custom text system such as: “STATIC VEIL”, “visual noise”, “shadow signal”, “blurred matter”, “a portrait reduced to rhythm”.\nCold, minimal, futuristic, powerful.\n\n2. SPECTRAL DRIFT\nA white-background experimental beauty portrait poster.\nA young female model in side or three-quarter profile, with one eye and facial structure remaining clear.\nControlled chromatic glitch trails in cyan, magenta, blue, and violet sweep horizontally across the face and body.\nThe effect should feel luminous and elegant.\nUse a custom text system such as: “SPECTRAL DRIFT”, “motion layer”, “color echo”, “synthetic portrait”, “light offset”, “frame memory”.\nClean, futuristic, vivid, dreamlike.\n\n3. SIGNAL FACE\nA white or light-gray portrait poster with a digital identity feeling.\nA young East Asian male model wearing slim black sunglasses, centered in frame.\nThe middle of the face remains sharp, while the edges of the hair, shoulders, and outline have soft motion blur and slight RGB drift.\nOverlay a subtle transparent grid across the composition.\nUse small blue accent text sparingly.\nUse a custom text system such as: “SIGNAL FACE”, “portrait sample”, “digital identity”, “soft focus study”, “visual layer”, “north field”.\nMinimal, precise, polished.\n\n4. NARROW BEAM\nA dark blue to black portrait poster with a moody experimental lighting setup.\nA young male model facing forward, with a narrow beam of light cutting across the eyes and upper face, while the lower face and body fade into darkness.\nAdd faint grid texture or very thin technical lines in the background.\nUse a custom text system such as: “NARROW BEAM”, “where shadow holds”, “vision remains”, “silence defines the frame”, “a study of presence held in blue”.\nQuiet, restrained, cinematic, intense.\n\nYou can swap the model, title, color logic, and effect treatment, while keeping the same overall quality: a clear focal point, original text, controlled distortion, and strong poster composition.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42084_out.png"]},{"i":4532,"text":"2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 famous days that made humans dream in this style = <explosive_commemorative_poster_diorama> MEDIUM: High-impact sports campaign poster fused with soft educational commemoration art and miniature paper-relief diorama construction. SURFACE: Cream paper grain, matte poster texture, layered paper-cut edges, printed halftone speckles, sharp graphic paint splatter, and raised diorama shadows. FORM: Central heroic subject staged like a campaign icon, surrounded by symbolic paper-relief scenery, bold graphic fragments, and informational poster elements. COLOR: Strong red, navy, white, and charcoal energy balanced with cream, pastel blue, mint, blush pink, soft beige, and muted educational-poster tones. LIGHTING: Dramatic campaign lighting on the central subject with soft diffused paper-world shadows around supporting elements. COMPOSITION: Large central figure or object, explosive graphic motion radiating outward, clean headline zones, symbolic icons, small diorama details, and poster-like hierarchy. MOOD: Heroic, celebratory, educational, explosive, commemorative, and emotionally uplifting. </explosive_commemorative_poster_diorama> <transformation> - Convert the subject into a central heroic poster figure or object with strong campaign-style presence. - Rebuild surrounding context as a layered paper-relief diorama with miniature symbolic scenery, soft rounded terrain, icons, badges, and simplified support figures. - Convert action, emotion, or importance into explosive red/navy/white graphic shards, paint splashes, motion streaks, and sharp triangular fragments. - Reinterpret factual, historical, competitive, or conceptual information as clean poster hierarchy, large headline zones, badge-like seals, icons, and short graphic callouts. - Replace realistic background complexity with cream poster space, soft educational shapes, paper-cut scenery, and controlled symbolic layout. - Convert small details into raised paper pieces, printed dots, tiny labels, simplified symbols, flags, charts, or commemorative marks. - Preserve the subject’s identity and pose, but make it feel like a premium public-campaign poster exploding into a handcrafted diorama world. </transformation> <typography_rules> - Use bold expressive headline areas only when relevant. - Let text be inferred from the subject, not hard-coded. - Use large block letters, brush-stroke lettering, poster labels, badge marks, or short educational callouts. - Keep all text minimal, graphic, and readable. </typography_rules> <shape_language> - Combine sharp explosive shards with soft paper-relief curves. - Use strong diagonals for impact and rounded pastel forms for warmth. - Keep the main subject powerful and readable from far away. - Let small diorama details reward close inspection. </shape_language> <finish> - Explosive sports-poster energy fused with soft commemorative paper diorama. - Heroic, tactile, graphic, educational, and highly viral. </finish> <avoid> - Avoid photoreal background clutter. - Avoid long paragraphs of text. - Avoid flat corporate infographic design. - Avoid fully soft pastel treatment with no impact. - Avoid random splatter; every burst should support the subject’s motion or importance. - Avoid hard-coded team names, dates, or labels unless provided by the subject. </avoid>","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42078_out.png"]},{"i":4533,"text":"这张摄影作品展现了一位充满少女感的女性，她处于梦幻般、以樱桃为主题的视觉空间中。人物拥有柔和的五官和精致的妆容，黑色长发自然垂落，点缀着鲜红的樱桃发饰。她身穿带有褶皱设计的浅粉色薄纱服饰，领口配有半透明的红胶质颈圈，整体风格极具二次元少女感与时尚插画审美。构图采用近景特写，强调人物眼神与前景樱桃造型的互动，利用大光圈实现极浅的景深，背景中充斥着充满空气感的红色气泡与光斑，营造出空灵且充满甜美气息的氛围。摄影方面，采用柔光布光，捕捉皮肤的细腻质感与透亮肤色，光线呈现出梦幻的柔焦效果。色彩基调为粉色与深红的和谐交织，视觉上极具冲击力。画面画质极高，细节丰富，色调鲜亮饱和，整体充满高级的艺术感，展现了现代潮流摄影的精致美学，宽高比为3:4。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42043_out.png"]},{"i":4534,"text":"A photorealistic natural selfie photo of a fictional 20-year-old adult Japanese woman, clearly adult, reimagined as a different person inspired by the reference pose and outfit only, Japanese idol-like cute face, short light brown bob hair with soft straight bangs, natural makeup, gentle glossy lips, bright relaxed eyes, playful cute smile, both index fingers lightly touching her cheeks, close-up vertical smartphone selfie composition, face filling most of the frame, slightly high front angle, warm indoor lounge or private room background with soft golden bokeh lights, shallow depth of field, natural candid off-shot style, clean magazine gravure, tasteful gravure style, subtle sensual mood, wearing an elegant white satin cheongsam-inspired sleeveless top, high collar, delicate floral jacquard texture, traditional knot buttons, tasteful side lace-up detail, securely covering the bust, large natural bust with soft natural fullness, natural gravity, natural roundness, subtle fabric tension around the chest and side seams, realistic satin sheen and fabric folds, narrow delicate shoulders, slim graceful arms, softly visible collarbone and underarm line, clean refined atmosphere, natural skin texture, slight imperfections, realistic pores, natural facial asymmetry, not overly symmetrical, photorealistic natural photo, high detail, realistic depth of field, not anime, not illustration, not overly retouched.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/42029_out.png"]},{"i":4535,"text":"Ultra-realistic candid smartphone photo, 3:4 vertical. Original non-identifiable young woman on a Jakarta sidewalk at night beside a white tiled wall. Mid-walk, half-profile, turning back with a shy smile, hand raised toward the camera. Flash fired during motion, strong handheld shake, heavy motion blur, ghosting, streaked tiles, deep shadows, blown highlights, imperfect framing, raw accidental snapshot, authentic noisy phone-camera aesthetic.\n\nNegative identity match, face copy, real person replication, anime, illustration, painting, CGI, stylized, studio lighting, beauty lighting, sharp focus, smooth skin, posed portrait, fashion editorial, cinematic, DSLR, tripod, professional photography","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/41662_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/41662_in0.png"]},{"i":4536,"text":"Adult female subject presented as a fashion magazine cover / poster collage: a large close-up portrait fills the background, while a smaller rectangular photo is layered over the lower center. She has messy black hair, both hands holding her face, copper-brown glossy nails, and an overall cool blue-gray seaside editorial feeling.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/41529_out.png"]},{"i":4537,"text":"A striking minimalist cinematic poster with a solid [Background Color] textured backdrop. Massive distressed typography reading “[Main Word]” dominates the composition in oversized bold condensed letters, with a small tagline “[Tagline]” positioned above or within the text. A small full-body silhouette of [Famous Person] stands or walks confidently in front of the typography, wearing [Outfit Description] and holding [Prop Or Symbolic Object]. The figure casts an oversized elongated shadow that stretches dramatically across the giant letters, becoming a central storytelling element. High-contrast lighting, subtle grunge texture, premium editorial design, bold negative space, modern minimalist composition, cinematic atmosphere, ultra-detailed, photorealistic, 8K, print-ready. But the context should be for \"I want the poster for a Company of a team named Smart Bros Run by 16-17yr boys, who want to build and grow it. It has sub branches Smart Bros Web providing web dev and video editing servics and Smart Bros Labs where the externa independent projects, R&D is done. Through the banner it should depict the idea as a whole in minimalist but modern style\"","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/41486_out.png"]},{"i":4538,"text":"Low angle luxury product photography of a black ribbed glass perfume bottle placed on a dark horizontal podium, shot from below for a heroic, monumental feel. The bottle is Tom Ford Black Orchid, matte black texture clearly visible.\nDramatic low key studio lighting. Soft diffused key light from above and slightly left, gently lighting the label and top, revealing volume and texture. Strong hard red rim light from behind and right, creating a bold red outline along the edge and cap, with a subtle red glow bleeding into the background.\nDeep soft shadows with smooth falloff. Slightly underexposed for drama. High contrast between highlights and shadows while keeping transitions soft.\nColor palette limited to deep black and rich burgundy red, warm color balance, black remains neutral and clean.\nMatte surface shows soft red reflections, not glossy, giving depth and form.\nMinimal background, dark red gradient, cinematic mood, luxury fragrance advertising style, photorealistic, ultra high detail, studio quality.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/41483_out.png"]},{"i":4539,"text":"Vertical 9:16 composition, realistic smartphone direct-flash photography. A young adult woman stands indoors in front of a dark grey-black geometric textured wall and a dark door, wearing a black-and-white Japanese-inspired maid cosplay outfit. She has dark brown almost black twin ponytails with straight bangs, decorated with white bow hair accessories on both sides. Her face is small with a soft chin, large eyes looking directly into the camera, and a calm sweet expression with a slightly cool distance, as if the flash caught her just after she settled into the pose.\n\nHer makeup follows a doll-like Japanese and East Asian social-media beauty style: clean fair base, soft pink blush around the under-eye and mid-face area, neat eyeliner, defined lashes, and muted pink lips. Her skin tone is fair and lightly warm, appearing brighter under the direct flash. The visible skin includes her face, neck, a small upper-chest cutout area, upper arms, forearms, hands, and part of one thigh. The skin should look smooth and delicate, tactile like soft cool porcelain mixed with natural skin softness, while still keeping subtle real skin texture rather than plastic smoothing.\n\nThe outfit is a black satin-like maid top with short puff sleeves, white ruffled shoulders, a high lace collar, white bow details, and a small chest cutout showing a restrained area of skin below the collarbone. The waist is covered and tightened by a white apron, while the hips are mostly covered by the skirt. The lower outfit is a black layered ruffle skirt with a white lace-trimmed apron and white thigh-high stockings. One thigh is clearly visible, with the stocking band fitted cleanly around the leg. Shoulders remain mostly covered by puff sleeves and ruffles; do not expose the waist or hips.\n\nHer body is slightly turned and leaning forward. One hand grips a long black baton-like cosplay prop, while the other hand supports it near the lower side. The prop crosses diagonally through the foreground from lower left to lower right. The camera angle is slightly low and looking upward, with the upper body close to the lens and a large portion of the textured ceiling visible above her, creating mild smartphone wide-angle perspective, similar to a 24-28mm phone lens with fairly deep depth of field.\n\nThe background is a narrow indoor space with dark grey, black-grey, and silvery linear geometric wall and ceiling textures, plus a dark door frame, dark brown or black door, and door handle. The main light is a hard phone flash near the lens, directly lighting the face, white apron, lace, arms, hands, and thigh. The black fabric absorbs light and creates deep shadows, while the hard flash reveals the raised wall texture and creates slight vignetting around the edges. The overall mood is quiet, cool-sweet, and authentic, like a casual social-media cosplay photo taken indoors at night, with slight asymmetry, real clothing wrinkles, and hard flash shadows preserved.\n\nNo logo, no watermark, no account ID, no Xiaohongshu mark, no platform UI, no stickers, and no extra text. Avoid plastic skin, over-retouching, bright studio lighting, western commercial glamour style, changing the black-and-white maid color palette, excessive exposure, extra fingers, deformed hands, or a distorted prop.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40918_out.png"]},{"i":4540,"text":"生成一张高级审美植物海报，竖版海报形式，整体气质安静、克制、柔和、有呼吸感。\n\n主体为一组纤细自然的植物花枝，花朵轻盈通透，带有淡淡朦胧感和微距摄影质感。背景干净留白，奶油白或浅暖灰色调，光线柔和，像晨光照进室内。画面具有高级生活方式杂志、植物美学刊物、艺术展视觉海报的感觉。\n\n构图要求：\n- 竖版海报\n- 主体植物自然伸展，前后景有虚实层次\n- 大面积留白，版式轻盈\n- 画面不要杂乱，不要商业广告感\n- 不要水印，不要乱码，不要过多装饰\n\n文字排版要求：\n- 海报必须带文字排版\n- 主标题使用中文，标题简洁有诗意\n- 可搭配少量英文副标题，但中文是视觉主角\n- 文字排版像独立杂志封面 / 艺术海报\n- 日期如需出现，使用 2026 或当日日期 2026.07.04\n- 不要每张文字都一样，标题、副标题、角标内容可变化\n- 文字要清晰、准确、可读，不要乱码\n\n风格关键词：\n植物摄影、柔焦、静物美学、杂志封面、艺术海报、东方气质、极简排版、温柔留白、呼吸感、轻复古纸张质感、高级审美。\n\n建议标题方向示例：\n《微光花事》\n《花枝呼吸》\n《风经过时》\n《植物与静默》\n《晨光标本》\n《柔软生长》","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40889_out.png"]},{"i":4541,"text":"A realistic vertical 9:16 smartphone photo, shot from a low upward angle. The camera feels placed below waist level or near the thighs, looking upward at the subject with mild 24-28mm smartphone wide-angle perspective exaggeration. The subject is an adult woman standing in a clean warm beige indoor space. Her body from the upper thighs, waist, and hips up to the head fills most of the frame; the light blue high-waisted jeans carry strong visual weight in the lower half, while the head sits close to the top edge.\n\nShe stands slightly angled, body leaning subtly left, head turned toward the upper right of the frame, not looking into the camera. Her expression is quiet, restrained, and slightly absent-minded, with naturally closed lips and no obvious smile, like a moment caught right before leaving the room. Preserve her side-profile contour, soft jawline, straight nose bridge, natural lip shape, and the slightly elongated neck line created by the low angle. The makeup follows an East Asian urban fashion beauty direction: natural base, soft contour, natural brows, restrained eye makeup, non-exaggerated lashes, and muted rose, dusty pink, or soft red-brown lips. The overall feeling is clean and mature, not heavy glam.\n\nHer hair is dark brown-black with a soft brown reflection under warm indoor light. It is styled in a low bun or low gathered updo, slightly loose, with natural face-framing strands around the ear, cheek, and jawline. Subtle warm highlights appear on the top of the hair, and the loose strands keep a realistic everyday softness and slight messiness.\n\nShe wears a black fitted off-shoulder long-sleeve top with a bandeau-like neckline. The fabric looks like fine knit or ribbed material, close to the body, with one shoulder clearly exposed and the sleeves covering the wrists. The bottom is light washed blue high-waisted denim jeans, with visible metal button, belt loops, front pockets, zipper fly, denim stitching, washed texture, and mild fabric creases. One hand holds a cream-white or ivory coat in front of her abdomen; the soft thick coat fabric gathers in the right foreground and forms a bright visual block.\n\nVisible skin includes the side of the face, ear, neck, collarbones, both shoulders, upper chest edge, a small area near the underarm, hands, and fingers. The waist, hips, and legs are covered by the top and jeans; back and buttock skin are not visible. Her skin tone is warm fair, appearing soft and creamy under indoor yellow-warm light. The skin should look fine, smooth, and softly diffused, suggesting a warm, clean, soft touch, while keeping natural bone shadows and skin transitions around the shoulders and collarbones instead of a plastic over-smoothed surface.\n\nLighting comes from warm overhead indoor light from above and slightly right, illuminating the top of the hair, side face, shoulders, collarbones, hand, and white coat. The black top absorbs light, creating soft shadows under the chin, around the chest fabric, and in the clothing folds; the white coat bounces a little gentle fill light. The background is a simple warm off-white room, fitting room, or hotel-like corridor, with a ceiling, wall corners, doorframe lines, and clean plain walls. Keep the real smartphone texture: slight noise, soft sharpness, uneven indoor exposure, low-angle wide-lens proportion shift, natural clothing folds, slight tilt, and imperfect framing. Avoid mirror selfie, visible phone, mirror reflection, watermark, logo, text, hard studio lighting, plastic skin, anime style, and exaggerated body curves.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40886_out.png"]},{"i":4542,"text":"深色哥德式武士女孩穿著武士刀,動作姿勢動感十足,長黑髮在空中揮舞,紅潤亮眼,黑色飾面,飾有黑色飾面,穿著蕾絲,穿著精緻的靴子,強烈表情,刀刃反射光線,戲劇性的動作組成,簡約簡潔的背景,水墨點綴,高調的對比陰影,優雅而致命的畫面,細膩的布料摺疊,充滿動感的動畫寫實,電影般的燈光、銳利的聚焦,傑作插畫——ar 9:16 --niji 7","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40883_out.png"]},{"i":4543,"text":"A realistic vertical 9:16 phone selfie, shot from an extremely close high angle, with the camera held above and slightly in front of the subject. The subject is an adult woman with a cool porcelain-pale complexion. Her face fills the upper half of the image, with delicate doll-like proportions: a small face, pointed chin, large clear round eyes, a narrow nose bridge, soft nose tip, and full muted rosy lips. She looks upward directly into the lens, her gaze quiet, bright, slightly innocent, and emotionally restrained, as if she had just lifted her head when the shutter was pressed.\n\nShe has long creamy platinum-blonde hair with slightly darker roots. The hair is mostly straight with natural soft bends, airy volume, and imperfect looseness. Many strands fall across her forehead and face; several thin strands sweep horizontally over her eyes, nose bridge, and lips, creating real foreground obstruction. The flash catches the hair in thin silky highlights. The hair should feel smooth and soft, but not overly neat.\n\nHer makeup follows an East Asian fashion / sweet-cool girl-group beauty direction: soft light-brown brows, thin lifted eyeliner, separated long lashes, subtle under-eye aegyo-sal, faint pink tones under the eyes, gentle highlight on the nose bridge and tip, barely-there blush, and muted rose-beige or soft pink gradient lips. Do not turn the face into mature Western glam, and avoid excessive retouching.\n\nShe wears a simple fitted black bare-shoulder bandeau or thin-strap low-cut top. The black fabric contrasts strongly with her cool pale skin. Visible skin includes the face, neck, collarbones, shoulders, upper chest, upper arms, forearm, hands, and parts of the thighs and knees near the bottom of the frame. The waist is mostly hidden by the high angle, hair, and clothing; the back, buttocks, and hips are basically not visible. The skin should look delicate, soft, and slightly powdery like thin velvet, suggesting a cool smooth touch while keeping real subtle skin transitions around the neck, shoulders, and collarbones. The lower body shows white lace thigh-high stockings with clear lace bands and floral texture, plus black pointed glossy shoes near the bottom.\n\nHer pose is seated or half-seated indoors. One arm reaches toward the camera for the selfie, entering the edge of the frame, while the other hand gathers her long hair. Her fingers show long decorative nails in pale pink, translucent glitter, or rhinestone style. The composition should feel slightly tilted and compressed by a wide-angle phone lens, preserving the real selfie evidence: arm in frame, messy hair obstruction, close-distance distortion, and imperfect framing.\n\nLighting comes from a close phone flash near the lens, directly illuminating the face, shoulders, collarbones, and upper chest. It creates cool white highlights, low shadows, slight overexposure, and a bright-front / dark-back contrast. The background falls into dim indoor ambient light. The setting is a nighttime lounge, café, or private booth-like space, with dark leather seating, a white marble round table, a black phone on the table, gray-white marble flooring, and small gold metallic decorative details. Keep the social-media snapshot texture: slight sharpening, dark-area noise, flash reflection, local overexposure, and casual uneven lighting rather than a polished studio look.\n\nThe mood is cool, refined, sweet-cool, intimate, and nocturnal, like a brief gaze left after something had already happened that night. Preserve the emotional residue, the close private distance, and the accidental realism. Avoid watermarks, platform logos, plastic skin, perfect symmetry, studio lighting, cartoon or anime style, exaggerated body curves, distorted hands, extra fingers, and an overly bright background.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40881_out.png"]},{"i":4544,"text":"Canada Design a cool red and white pass: hand holds a frosted pass with Toronto/host city diorama and BMO Field. A ball emerges with maple leaf confetti and northern lights particles. Background: CN Tower and lakefront at twilight. Composition: pass 50%, football 20%, city 30%. Style: cinematic, crisp cold tones, volumetric light, collectible poster quality.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40878_out.png"]},{"i":4545,"text":"Above:\nThe graphic design of a high-end streetwear T-shirt, with a solid pure yellow background, printed texture, bold composition. The upper half of the picture features a striking large 3D graffiti-style text pattern, reading \"New Class.\" The font is large, using a highly realistic spray paint texture effect. The color is consistent with the background. Each letter has varying shades, casting a strong dramatic shadow on the following letters. The text is slightly tilted, presenting a confident posture. \nMiddle section: Reserve some clean areas \nBelow:\nWhite graffiti pen strokes, sticker labels, stars, editing icons.\nSmall barcode elements, subtle paper texture.\nOccupying both sides of the image, adding an editing-style street texture.\nThe surface is covered with a layer of subtle screen-printed damaged texture, giving the overall design a genuine retro falling-off effect.\nOverall aesthetic style:\nCombines Supreme, Off-White and contemporary art trend culture, with clear printable graphic quality, thick and confident lines, perfectly suitable for direct printing on clothing, pure yellow background.\nHigh-end sports fashion promotional lighting.\nSharp highlights, intense shadows. \nAspect ratio:\n9:16 vertical.\nLuxury commercial fashion event.\nVery detailed.\n8K masterpiece.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40875_out.png"]},{"i":4546,"text":"围绕任意主题对象生成一张强透视的文字空间视觉：画面像一条由主题关键词和短句构成的深邃通道，文字不是普通排版，而是铺满两侧、顶部与地面的巨大信息墙，沿同一个消失点急速缩小、翻转、倒置、拉伸，形成压迫性的视觉回声；近处字形巨大到被边缘裁切，远处字形密集收束，中央留出一个强烈发光的出口或空白核心，让观者先感到被文字包围，再被远处光源牵引。主题主体只作为极小的尺度锚点或象征性行动者出现在通道中心附近，背光成剪影，脚下带长投影，强化孤独、前进、蜕变或被信息推向选择的情绪。色彩从主题自身的情绪、材质与语义中提取，保留大面积低明度结构底色、少量高饱和信息强调色、极亮洁净出口光和清晰明暗阶梯的关系，整体冷静、紧张、锋利而干净，强调色承担情绪冲击，暗部承担空间深度，光源承担希望与方向，避免脏灰、复古泛黄或装饰性渐变。字体使用粗重无衬线、紧凑字距和重复节奏，文字既要形成可识别的信息压力，也要服从空间透视与墙面结构；底部或前景可放置一个极大的主题动词或核心宣言，与通道文字形成近景压迫和远景召唤的双层阅读。\n\n\n——————\n成长宣言: 自我突破+行动关键词+白色出口+前进者剪影\n手机海报用途: 个人成长课程封面+社群打卡开屏\n冷感配色: 深海蓝+银灰白+电光青+暗场高对比\n主视觉重心: 单人背影居中+尽头强光门洞+近景巨型动词裁切\n比例：16:9","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40814_out.png"]},{"i":4547,"text":"Vertical 9:16 close-up nighttime bedroom phone selfie portrait. A young woman is lying on a bed or soft bedding, leaning very close to the camera, her face placed from the lower-right toward the center of the frame. The camera sits slightly below face level, as if shot from bed or tabletop height, with a subtle tilted composition. Keep the real low-light phone selfie feeling: mild digital noise, compressed dark areas, and a spontaneous imperfect frame.\n\nShe looks directly into the lens with large clear eyes, fine black eyeliner, curled lashes, soft pink-brown eyeshadow, and a subtle aegyo-sal effect. Her expression is calm, soft, and slightly absent-minded, like a tired late-night pause. Her lips are gently closed with glossy rose-pink lip tint. Preserve a small soft face shape, delicate nose bridge, gentle jawline, clean transparent base makeup, and realistic skin texture rather than plastic smoothing. The makeup direction should feel like Korean / Xiaohongshu-style nighttime selfie beauty.\n\nHer hair is long, straight, dark brown almost black, naturally parted slightly off-center, falling close to the cheeks and shoulder, with a few fine loose strands across the forehead. The crown and hair edges catch cool blue-purple reflections. She wears a loose pale gray-white or cool light blue-gray knitted sweater with a slipped off-shoulder neckline, revealing one shoulder, the neck, collarbones, and a small upper-chest area near the neckline. The waist, legs, and bottom clothing are not visible; do not invent extra exposed body areas. Visible skin includes the face, neck, collarbones, one shoulder, a small upper-chest area, and partial fingers. Her skin tone is fair and natural, made porcelain-cool by the blue-purple light; the shoulder and neck skin should feel soft, clean, and slightly cool, as if covered by late-night screen light.\n\nThe main light is a close blue-purple LED or screen-like glow from the lower-left front, washing across the cheeks, nose bridge, neck, shoulder, knit sweater, and foreground objects. The opposite side of the face remains darker, while a narrow weak warm light along the left door or mirror frame creates a cool-warm contrast. In the foreground, place a white ceramic cup with blue handwritten-style lettering and a dark-covered book or magazine, partially blocking the lower frame. The background is a dim bedroom or dorm room: a slanted door frame or mirror frame on the left, a half-open wardrobe with hanging dark and light clothes, a black decorative picture or bag above it, and white bedding. The atmosphere is quiet, intimate, and believable, as if she had been lying in bed late at night with the cup and book still there, then looked up into the lens while the blue-purple light was still on.\n\nNegative plastic skin, over retouched, heavy glamour lighting, extra exposed body, wide smile, bad hands, distorted face, harsh flash, clean studio background, over saturated neon, cartoon, anime, low detail eyes.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40640_out.png"]},{"i":4548,"text":"A highly detailed digital artwork in a surreal, dynamic style inspired by premium athletic advertising for Nike, Inc. A young athletic woman with platinum blonde hair tied in a messy bun, fair skin, and a fiercely focused expression is captured mid-jump or leap, her body leaning slightly forward as if bursting with raw, untamed energy.\nShe wears a loose, off-white Nike crewneck sweatshirt with subtle embossed Nike branding on the chest, paired with flowy, semi-transparent pants featuring a swirling marbled pattern in graphite grey and electric violet, billowing dramatically around her legs. On her feet are sleek, futuristic white Nike sneakers with glowing violet accents, visible Air-inspired sole details, and an aerodynamic design.\nVibrant electric violet energy or ethereal smoke erupts dramatically from behind her, swirling and dissolving into abstract, cloud-like forms that interact with her clothing, creating a powerful sense of motion and release.\nThe background is a deep, moody gradient transitioning from charcoal grey to luminous twilight violet, emphasizing a minimalist yet striking composition.\nOverlay large, bold metallic silver text reading “Just Do It” in a sharp, modern sans-serif font, partially integrated and obscured by the energy smoke and the figure, making it feel like an organic part of the scene.\nInclude the iconic Nike Swoosh logo in the top-left corner in shimmering silver.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40515_out.png"]},{"i":4549,"text":"editorial portrait, Korean female idol, subtly sensual outfit: silk shirt or soft fabric top, slightly loose, elegant and flowing pose: body slightly turned away, face partially visible, one hand near collar or neck expression: soft but unreadable, eyes partially hidden lighting: strong directional light (window light), casting shadows across face and body background: dark or minimal interior composition: partial visibility, half-lit face, shadow covering features mood: mysterious, intimate, quiet tension style: cinematic editorial, light and shadow storytelling sensuality: created through concealment and ambiguity","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40511_out.png"]},{"i":4550,"text":"Transparent late-night selfie makeup inspired by East Asian urban phone portraits: thin base, subtle under-eye shine, natural brown-black eyeliner, long lashes, muted pink-brown eyeshadow, lightly flushed nose and cheeks, and low-saturation rosy-pink glossy lips.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40445_out.png"]},{"i":4551,"text":"主題：\n朝の急ぎ足\n\n人物・表情：\n20代女性。明るいアイボリーベージュ寄りの白肌に、ほんのりピンクの血色を含んだ自然な肌理。淡いローズピンクのチーク、シャンパンベージュとピンクブラウンのアイシャドウ、細く長いまつ毛、自然な涙袋、透け感のあるピンクベージュのリップ。瞳には小さなキャッチライト。トーストを口にくわえ、少し慌てながらも明るい表情で階段を駆け下りている。\n\n服装・ポーズ：\n白い半袖のセーラー風ブラウス、上品なネイビーの襟と袖ライン、大きめで形のきれいなネイビーリボン。高めのウエストで整ったネイビーのプリーツスカート、白いソックス、黒のローファー。人物の右足は下の段へ踏み出し、左足は後ろへ軽く跳ね上がる。人物の左手でバッグのストラップを握り、右手は髪の近くで小さく上がっている。スカートと髪が走る勢いで自然に揺れる。\n\n背景・光：\n駅前にある歩道橋の階段。金属の手すり、屋根のある通路、奥にぼけた駅案内や街の看板。朝の強い日差しが画面右上から入り、顔、ブラウス、脚、階段の端を明るく照らす。階段には手すりの影が斜めに落ち、明るい部分と影の部分のコントラストをはっきり出す。空気に少しだけ白い光のにじみを入れる。\n\n構図・カメラ：\n縦長2:3、全身が入る構図。人物を中央やや右に配置し、階段と手すりの線で奥行きを作る。カメラはやや低め、正面から少し見上げる角度。人物にピントを合わせ、背景は自然にぼかす。走っている一瞬を止めたようなスナップ写真。\n\n質感・スタイル：\nリアルな日系ストリートフォト。明るい夏の朝、柔らかなハイライト、自然な肌の質感、髪一本一本の流れが見える繊細な描写。髪は明るいミルクティーアッシュブラウン、薄めのシースルーバング、顔まわりに沿うレイヤーカット、肩下のミディアムロング。毛先は内側にゆるくカールし、走る動きでふわっと広がる。バッグは濃いブラウンの日本風スクールバッグで、テディベア、小さな白いぬいぐるみ、リボン、ふわふわのキーホルダー、ビーズチャームを複数吊るす。\n\nネガティブ：\n不自然な顔や視線、余分または欠けた指、手足の融合、関節の破綻、浮いた足、重力に合わない髪やスカート、バッグの飾りの崩れ、道具との接触不良、光源と矛盾する影、過度な美肌補正、プラスチックのような肌、文字化け、ロゴ、透かし、不要な人物。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40339_out.png"]},{"i":4552,"text":"あなたは一流のアートディレクター兼日本語タイポグラファー。下記を「制作手順」として STEP 1 から順番に積み上げ、アスペクト比4:5の実写エディトリアル広告ポスターを1枚仕上げる。各STEPを前のSTEPの結果の上に重ねていくこと。\n\n【添付】1枚目＝SNSプロフィールのスクショ、2枚目＝本人写真またはアイコン画像\n\n━ STEP 1｜見出しの一単語を決める ━\n・スクショの肩書き・自己紹介・ジャンルを読み取り、その人を象徴する英単語を1語だけ選ぶ（例：デザイン系→DESIGN）。名前は使わない。この1語が主役。\n\n━ STEP 2｜白い全面の上に、その一単語を90度回転させて左に寝かせて置く ━\n・背景は白の全面\n・選んだ一単語を丸ごと反時計回りに90度回転させて横倒しにする（文字が横に倒れている状態）\n・その巨大な横倒し文字を、画面の左側を起点に、画面の高さいっぱいの超特大サイズで配置する\n\n━ STEP 3｜「文字＋四角」のクリッピングマスクを作る ━\n・このSTEPでは写真はまだ使わない。マスク（切り抜き用の型）だけを作る\n・STEP 2で制作した巨大な横倒し文字と同じ縦幅の四角いブロックを足す。\nこの四角いブロックは巨大な横倒し文字の端に重ねておき、ブロックの横幅を画面の端まで伸ばす。\nただしSTEP 2で制作した文字サイズは変えず、四角いブロックの横幅だけを最大限まで伸ばすこと。\n・その２つの図形を「合体」させたクリッピングマスクを作成する。\n\n━ STEP 4｜人物画像を画面いっぱいに置き、STEP 3のマスクで切り抜く ━\n・添付の人物画像を、顔が画面いっぱいに大きく来るよう拡大・トリミングして、画面全体に配置する\n・その写真を、STEP 3で作ったマスクの形で切り抜く（クリッピング）。マスクの内側にだけ写真が見え、内側は途切れのない1枚の写真で満たされる\n\n━ STEP 5｜空いたスペースに小さいテキストを配置する ━\n・STEP4で仕上げた画像に、スクショから読み取った情報を英語に訳して配置する\n・STEP4の画像の左右に、スクショから読み取った情報を配置するための白ベタを作成。\n・小さいテキストも90度回転（横倒し）にして、余白に沿って縦のライン状に流す（水平では置かない）\n・左：TITLE＝本人名／ROLE／EXPERIENCE／SOCIAL、短い引用リード／右：@ハンドル／企画名／西暦\n・詰め込みすぎず、バランスを見て配置する\n\n━ STEP 6｜仕上げ要素を足す ━\n・下部に細いバーコード風グラフィックを水平に入れる。小さなドットやライン等の最小限の装飾で余白を整える\n\n【全STEP共通の質感】\n・添付した人物写真やアイコンは「人物像のインスピレーション元」として扱う。顔をそのまま複製・再現するのではなく、そこから読み取れる雰囲気・髪型・髪色・メガネや小物・服のテイスト・表情の柔らかさなどの特徴を引き継ぐ\n・添付がイラストやキャラクターアイコンの場合も、色使い・髪型・メガネ・雰囲気などの特徴を読み取り、それを反映した実写モデルに変換する\n・過度にAIっぽくせず、実在の広告撮影のような自然な表情・肌・髪・姿勢・服の質感にする\n・明るくハイキーで抜け感のある光（暗い室内・沈んだグレー禁止）\n・配色はスクショ由来を広告向けに再設計、視線を止めるポイントカラーを1つ\n・普通のビジネス服は避け、世界観に合う個性的なスタイリング\n・アスペクト比4:5、高解像度、ファッション広告品質","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40337_out.png"]},{"i":4553,"text":"Natural cool-toned East Asian bedroom portrait makeup: thin base, softly flushed nose tip and cheeks, muted pink-brown eyeshadow, natural eyeliner, long lashes, and soft matte nude-pink lips, like leftover makeup late at night before removing it.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40331_out.png"]},{"i":4554,"text":"16 character profile poster of Sheena, a 20-year-old trendy girl with a sweet wink and confident cool pose. Keep her recognizable face, soft features, big eyes, and braided hairstyle. Restyle her in fashionable streetwear with layered accessories and chunky sneakers. Add irregular overlapping collage panels showing close-ups of her eyes, hair, face, hands, waist, legs, and shoes, each with different poses and angles. Use premium editorial design, Y2K street fashion, chrome typography, dynamic depth, rich details, and clean English poster text: “SHEENA”, “AGE 20”, “165CM”, “47KG”. Ultra-detailed, sharp, stylish, polished, modern fashion poster\n\nNegative \nlow quality, blurry, distorted face, wrong identity, extra fingers, bad hands, broken anatomy, duplicate body, messy layout, unreadable text, misspelled words, watermark, logo, heavy blur, overexposed, underexposed, plastic skin, AI artifacts, inappropriate outfit, overly revealing clothing, childish body, deformed shoes, bad composition","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40277_out.png"]},{"i":4555,"text":"{\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"camera\": \"iPhone 17 Pro\",\n    \"lens\": \"24mm\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\",\n    \"style\": \"iphone flash shot, raw, high contrast, no editing\"\n  },\n\n  \"scene\": {\n    \"location\": \"dim bedroom\",\n    \"time\": \"night\",\n    \"atmosphere\": \"late night, slightly chaotic calm\"\n  },\n\n  \"lighting\": {\n    \"primary\": \"iphone flash\",\n    \"secondary\": \"very dim ambient\",\n    \"temperature\": \"neutral\",\n    \"effect\": [\n      \"sharp highlights on face\",\n      \"deep background shadows\",\n      \"glossy skin reflections\"\n    ]\n  },\n\n  \"camera\": {\n    \"angle\": \"close and slightly low\",\n    \"distance\": \"face + upper torso\",\n    \"framing\": \"tight crop, imperfect\"\n  },\n\n  \"subject\": {\n    \"identity\": \"BLACKPINK Lisa inspired, bold gaze, clean features\",\n    \"pose\": {\n      \"position\": \"leaning slightly toward camera\",\n      \"shoulders\": \"relaxed\"\n    },\n    \"expression\": {\n      \"eyes\": \"direct, intense, slightly teasing\",\n      \"lips\": \"soft but controlled\"\n    },\n    \"hair\": {\n      \"style\": \"slightly messy straight hair with bangs\"\n    },\n    \"outfit\": {\n      \"top\": {\n        \"type\": \"thin strap top\",\n        \"color\": \"grey\",\n        \"fit\": \"tight minimal\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"iphone_realism\": {\n    \"imperfections\": [\n      \"flash blowout\",\n      \"grain\",\n      \"lens distortion\"\n    ]\n  }\n}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40256_out.png"]},{"i":4556,"text":"A premium 9:16 editorial portrait.Main Subject:An ultra close-up portrait of a young male model.A giant Fresnel lens partially covers the portrait.Its concentric rings create dramatic magnification and compression across one side of the face.Typography:\"FOCUS DIFFERENT\"Style:Optical engineering aesthetic.Luxury editorial photography.Minimal composition.Ultra detailed.8K masterpiece.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40126_out.png"]},{"i":4557,"text":"Ultra-realistic vertical everyday lifestyle photography, 9:16. A beautiful young Thai woman with naturally fair skin and long silky black hair is captured while walking away before gently turning her upper body back toward the camera with a bright genuine smile.\n\nShe wears a simple white crop top and casual shorts. Her naturally elegant shoulders, neckline, collarbones, slim waist, feminine silhouette, and long legs create an effortless lifestyle fashion appearance without posing.\n\nCamera angle: slightly behind her at waist height.\nComposition: dynamic leading lines from the old white buildings guide attention toward the subject.\nBackground: weathered white walls, vintage windows, faded textures, soft blue sky, natural daytime ambiance.\n\nBright white daylight with soft shadows.\nClassic CCD digital camera aesthetic featuring subtle grain, faint digital sensor noise, crisp focus, slightly blown highlights, nostalgic compact-camera colors, candid documentary feeling, authentic everyday life.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40125_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40125_in0.png"]},{"i":4558,"text":"A stunning, high-resolution close-up portrait of an East Asian woman, gazing directly at the camera with a soulful expression. She is in a softly lit room, bathed in a warm, golden-orange sunlight coming from the side, filtered through venetian blinds. This lighting creates distinct, dark, parallel stripe shadows across her face, eyes, and hair, giving the composition a dramatic, cinematic feel. Her skin has a soft, sun-kissed, and smooth texture. She wears vibrant, glossy red lipstick that reflects the light, and small, ornate pearl drop earrings, partially in shadow. She is wearing a cozy, red knit turtleneck sweater. Subtle icons are placed on the collar: a tiny, stylized red heart to her lower left and a small white dove to the lower right. Her brown eyes are full of expression, reflecting the light, and her brown hair is slightly wavy and soft. The background is a soft, dark, indeterminate gradient, enhancing the contrast and focus on her face. The style is an editorial-quality, intimate beauty photograph with rich color grading.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/40124_out.png"]},{"i":4559,"text":"An adult young woman leaning beside a black vintage motorcycle, wearing an oversized black suit jacket, white shirt, black tie, black trousers, and glossy black heels. The image feels like a cold white studio motorcycle-agent editorial: strong black-and-white contrast, quiet posture, and residual action-film tension.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/39901_out.png"]}];